[{"title":"贺汤弟迁居","author":"祝允明","text":"与尔为中表，嗟予多别离。\n称觞看雁翥，迁木指莺期。\n杖策时当过，停云不用思。\n加餐更相祝，行复入京师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52725,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行近白云泉有遥呼于林屋乃瘦石大参也适受风归急不得往抵舍疾甚少间驰怀得句奉呈","author":"祝允明","text":"小车芳径出金山，瞥见仙人水石间。\n后客应推先客主，行云不及定云閒。\n烟霞自熟孙登啸，笙鹤应嗤阮肇还。\n想有题名耀丘壑，可能镵我共苍颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52726,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿徐瘦石大参七十","author":"祝允明","text":"邯郸枕里了功名，安乐窝中适性情。\n瘦石烟霞无尽藏，小山鸡犬亦长生。\n云间彩凤衔金简，花底青鸾度玉笙。\n我是橘中同奕者，定骑龙尾共瑶京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52727,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题徐子芳秋庭","author":"祝允明","text":"孺子间居与世忘，萧萧深院映虚堂。\n露漙玉干桐孙长，霜饱金丸橘子香。\n白版拄颐迎灏爽，素丝横膝答清商。\n知君不是趋炎客，长啸一声天地凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52728,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅雪","author":"祝允明","text":"阊门佳丽锦为城，中有仙人降玉京。\n罗峤有花花解语，姑山若雪雪能行。\n秾如桃李先当素，乡自温柔剩得清。\n小室维摩唤天女，鬓丝相映老卿卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52729,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽都良玉","author":"祝允明","text":"曾为瓜圃平生传，今读东阳哭死诗。\n彫谢不禁前辈叹，风仪长系后人思。\n林猿惊上新华表，鸥鸟来衔旧钓丝。\n轩冕知非公素愿，凤毛方占上林枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52730,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽沈材广","author":"祝允明","text":"当年校艺每同君，长羡昂昂鹤在群。\n半点功名骰子选，一时声价战场文。\n空斋老菊啼秋露，高冢新松起暮云。\n人世漫哀冥世慰，满枝芳桂散华芬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52731,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽陕妇人","author":"祝允明","text":"岂谓中途失少君，断琴残瑟乱纷纷。\n梨花寒食夫君梦，知逐秦台几处云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52732,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿陈叟","author":"祝允明","text":"浑然风气在丘园，阳抱山前白板门。\n得得锄头三寸泽，悠悠葛藟百年根。\n旌旃不用来天使，轩冕难辞出子孙。\n还记三粳兼七秫，寿乡无日不开尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52733,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿王贞斋七十","author":"祝允明","text":"十霜相别又相迎，只是当时一样清。\n天上选仙惟在善，物中多寿必由贞。\n乡宾近受邦侯礼，家瑞重看子姓成。\n知道洞庭波不竭，年年酿入紫霞觥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52734,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢道士挽诗","author":"祝允明","text":"云房覆清址，犹自锁虚寒。\n耿耿鹤一只，萧萧竹数竿。\n友人留药饵，弟子宝簪冠。\n欲续周师传，传师与众看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52735,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月槎","author":"祝允明","text":"老夫欲问广寒事，只欠扁舟渡海云。\n闻有月槎须借我，授来灵诀却传君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52736,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松寿 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"陶径曾蒙元亮抚，君家今辱武功题。\n护持长使松无恙，桑梓清阴百岁齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52737,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松寿 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"手种长松已合围，翩然骑鹤海天飞。\n月明露下虬枝冷，不见人归见鹤归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52738,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海槎","author":"祝允明","text":"老蘖飘摇渤澥滨，偶然飞上卧闲身。\n衣沾织女湔裙水，石访成都卖卜人。\n九汉珠玑光夺镜，三壶宫阙气如银。\n知君半是神仙骨，携我明年一问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52739,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题人扇","author":"祝允明","text":"扇功本在驱炎上，不似屏风只好看。\n算得题诗真拙计，却供双眼失清寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52740,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸦","author":"祝允明","text":"日中燖得羽毛纁，强效忠来谁愿闻。\n四十颇能知学易，眼前消息不劳君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52741,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹","author":"祝允明","text":"淇园一枝春雨足，渭川千亩秋风高。\n先生青眼对君子，撚落吟须如凤毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52742,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙","author":"祝允明","text":"罢散天花下紫坛，露横秋袂水鸣环。\n凌波欲接君王去，又恐繁霜不耐寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52743,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"祝允明","text":"赞重清芳却恨迟，诗人曾费几多词。\n春风无限无名草，莫道芙蓉不遇时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52744,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"含笑","author":"祝允明","text":"如皋未射息侯亡，不作梁家龋齿妆。\n春色晏然花事好，肯将烽火误君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52745,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛夷花","author":"祝允明","text":"春丛绀碧杂殷红，不受中书旧日封。\n嬴政少恩君幸免，年年何事只书空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52746,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉兔","author":"祝允明","text":"霜寒玉线乱秋衣，叶重花深草气肥。\n灵药更无人肯饵，素娥应道不如归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52747,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"衔芦雁","author":"祝允明","text":"岁岁随阳计，秋风三尺芦。\n上林光景好，不见子卿书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52748,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和日本僧省佐咏其国中源氏园白樱花","author":"祝允明","text":"剪云雕雪下瑶空，缀向苍柯翠叶中。\n晋代桃源何足问，蓬山异卉是仙风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52749,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牵牛花","author":"祝允明","text":"药品能攻疾，花名强效人。\n应无渡河想，且免服箱辛。\n壳绽金铃子，苞舒碧角巾。\n步行骑水牯，欲觅了无因。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52750,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹡鸰","author":"祝允明","text":"长枕三郎作颂时，桂宫兰殿重含思。\n宁哥可是知人意，小院梨花玉笛吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52751,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹌鹑","author":"祝允明","text":"利口如锥岂利身，名题越调耳常新。\n莫教轻与人将去，又遣金陵枉杀人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52752,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣宗皇帝画马图","author":"祝允明","text":"昔日宣皇履至尊，尧章焕焕满乾坤。\n三千在御均承宠，一匹沾恩便不群。\n马法尽来空地类，龙图呈处是天文。\n丹青不逐乌号去，从此房星似掩昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52753,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家藏刘松年小方","author":"祝允明","text":"暗门终日痼烟霞，写得东南处处佳。\n湖上烟波志和宅，山阴风雪戴逵家。\n老僧引涧穿新竹，童子和云扫落花。\n揖客入门如有影，石墙松盖夕阳斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52754,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家藏李兴宗毛女","author":"祝允明","text":"宝瑟无弦尚自随，秦声那复记当时。\n山头剥枣分猿吃，云里巢笙唤鹤骑。\n见说刘郎驱项籍，空劳徐市觅安期。\n华阴万树长松叶，却笑君王未得知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52755,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小米山水","author":"祝允明","text":"襄阳松沈未曾乾，十里潇湘五尺宽。\n樵径不禁苔露滑，渔蓑常带水云寒。\n澄澄僧眼连天碧，澹澹蛾眉隔雾看。\n恐为醉翁当日写，平山堂上雨中观。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52756,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家藏高尚书松阴落涧图","author":"祝允明","text":"倚壑高松一万株，拂岩飞瀑氎巾铺。\n白龙隐映苍龙舞，山气虚兼水气濡。\n净壁沈沈悬瑀佩，空堂隐隐奏笙竽。\n平生负得匡庐约，幸拜尚书赐不孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52757,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子昂小景 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"春山雨新沐，掩霭结浓绿。\n一叶金芙蓉，粲粲迎朝旭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52758,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子昂小景 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"渔舟何所至，两两镜光中。\n沿洄溯春涨，更喜天无风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52759,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子昂小景 其三","author":"祝允明","text":"江亭小于艇，松子落满顶。\n尽日无人来，流水抱虚影。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52760,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子昂小景 其四","author":"祝允明","text":"晴阳破岚暝，水色当春和。\n如何异人境，而有樵者歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52761,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子昂小景 其五","author":"祝允明","text":"隔坞有绝壁，萝扉对山开。\n客子何为者，能入深山来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52762,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴镇小笔","author":"祝允明","text":"树欲化龙先带雨，泉将归海已如涛。\n直恐化人移幻境，莫誇墨沈与霜毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52763,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戴文进小幅","author":"祝允明","text":"峭壁遥撑落照危，蜿蜿曲陇绕脩陂。\n前头径转峰回境，说与时人定不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52764,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈徵君遇小景 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"藤花垂露媚苍龙，山静岚深草气融。\n紫褐玉琴空指点，白云楼阁锁重重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52765,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈徵君遇小景 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"净壁虚亭杨柳青，阑干白祫午风轻。\n披残一卷黄庭诀，不见人声有鹤声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52766,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边文进翎毛二首 其二 樱桃白头翁","author":"祝允明","text":"的历丹饴妃女唇，含来名重不胜春。\n柏梁台上刘郎老，断送因他郭舍人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52767,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题徵明画","author":"祝允明","text":"苍帻滃沈雾，白氎垂虚泉。\n归帆信流水，万襟同澹然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52768,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徵明墨菊","author":"祝允明","text":"冻砚呵寒下笔迟，须眉幻出陆天随。\n知君绕指冰霜走，更把冰霜吐作词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52769,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金山图","author":"祝允明","text":"昔年曾趁海门潮，独向龙宫吊寂寥。\n衬席寒风不成梦，老蛟一夜献琼瑶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52770,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题何大参菊花图卷子","author":"祝允明","text":"花有仙灵笔有神，化权终不在阳春。\n一般秋色成千品，前度桃花却后尘。\n谁信珠玑颜色好，独怜霜雪性情亲。\n菊诗万首从君选，未必微篇愧古人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52771,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题子畏墨竹","author":"祝允明","text":"唐郎写竹如写字，正以风情韵度高。\n我解平章不能写，未曾分得凤凰毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52772,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡马图","author":"祝允明","text":"骏骨千金产，名王万里归。\n风烟辞大漠，云电赴皇畿。\n立仗容陪舞，从龙敢假威。\n此来空地类，苜蓿近郊肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52773,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省耕图","author":"祝允明","text":"老农真我事，何敢笑樊须。\n植杖芸苗处，伸眉纳税馀。\n锄头三寸泽，田舍五行书。\n饱饭高眠熟，朱门未必如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52774,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子儋画梅","author":"祝允明","text":"子儋屋润体复胖，写出冰花朵朵寒。\n何物指头能尔许，元来铁石是心肝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52775,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琵琶士女","author":"祝允明","text":"马上明妃万里行，四条弦里断肠声。\n如今纤手朱丝底，不唱离情唱合情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52776,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伫立士女","author":"祝允明","text":"非缘望远上秦楼，杨柳依依翠陌头。\n画就远山调锦瑟，最怜夫婿不封侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52777,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"一溪流水半山云，山桂绵绵日夕芬。\n莫言丘壑藏名姓，高士他年自传君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52778,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道士鹅","author":"祝允明","text":"曾从老远说遗经，净影堂前几岁听。\n未必右军今有笔，莫将轻易换黄庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52779,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"寒光交逗眼苍然，半夜人间别有天。\n想得非仙亦非鬼，四山风雨拥孤眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52780,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"秋浸具区天地寒，老崖垂脚怒龙蟠。\n仙人夜半骑龙去，木客潜窥古灶丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52781,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"断崖横截傲崇冈，风叶满林斜日黄。\n十岁采薪多伴侣，不知翁子有他肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52782,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其四","author":"祝允明","text":"五月江湖风雨多，钓矶平没夜来波。\n深林中有扬雄宅，莫怪时人载酒过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52783,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其五","author":"祝允明","text":"云母薄梳青石发，水花肥点碧荷钱。\n树根一坐空山老，不许时人问岁年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52784,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其六","author":"祝允明","text":"赤城霞断逗秋晖，阊阖风高不耐衣。\n极目水天无了际，先生何处朗吟飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52785,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其七","author":"祝允明","text":"滃合浮云晚放晴，溪山相照寂无声。\n不知问字人何处，门外孤舟尽日横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52786,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其八","author":"祝允明","text":"面面青山曲曲溪，流云易度石墙低。\n苔生任把门踪合，鹤返容教树杪栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52787,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其九","author":"祝允明","text":"琅琊台顶太山杪，我欲去登须御风。\n稽首东皇拱双手，金乌高捧一轮红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52788,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其十","author":"祝允明","text":"烂银盘圆一千里，白玉髓喷三万重。\n老蛟背驮龙女泣，百斛宝珠抛海东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52789,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其十一","author":"祝允明","text":"霞捲夕阳天外天，抗风疏柳几枝偏。\n抛将湿网坡头晒，且旁网边乘醉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52790,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其十二","author":"祝允明","text":"暗崖悬立玉龙飞，怒蹴层冰万马齐。\n半夜哀音和空谷，愁翻木客唤猿啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52791,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其十三","author":"祝允明","text":"玄文草罢坐川湄，川与心同清静时。\n此地可忘新汉事，莫将轻易与人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52792,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其十四","author":"祝允明","text":"溪桥回转鸟声微，杖屦萧萧两布衣。\n不是耕夫出莘野，秋风落日采薇归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52793,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其十五","author":"祝允明","text":"老石空林了此生，一江秋水对人清。\n扁舟若为求鱼出，莫向茆亭脚下行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52794,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其十七","author":"祝允明","text":"天空地阔偶相逢，散漫寒流砢閜松。\n不用方舟细商略，到头岐路总难同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52795,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其二十","author":"祝允明","text":"覆有高林载有苔，石公木客可参陪。\n山居事业略完具，只是无人肯入来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52796,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其二十一","author":"祝允明","text":"破屋依依寂寞滨，千山头白树存身。\n洛阳县令曾知否，中有饥吟僵卧人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52797,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其二十二","author":"祝允明","text":"阔屦宽袍顶不巾，天和拍拍面浮春。\n横拖杖子前山去，知是人间不吏人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52798,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其二十三","author":"祝允明","text":"秋水浮船五尺深，也无情事到讴吟。\n十年荡桨无人问，却有飞鸿识我心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52799,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]